WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.040 --> 00:00:06.704
Select an OCR-enabled lane (Lane45–Lane50) in SensorHub Admin and open Vehicle OCR to verify Enable Vehicle OCR.

2
00:00:06.744 --> 00:00:16.077
Open Event Details in OSCAR Viewer to inspect ISO 6346 OCR suggestion chips, Vehicle ID auto-fill, and Multi-Pass Vehicle History.

3
00:00:16.117 --> 00:00:25.216
Click COMPARE PASSES and LOAD RADIATION TRACES to inspect cross-lane transits, OCR crops, and overlaid radiation waveforms.

4
00:00:25.256 --> 00:00:37.517
Select Adjudicate disposition and Secondary Inspection status, then confirm append-only submission.
